<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex raised.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said Tuesday it had raised its rating on Mexican telephone company Telefonos de Mexico to outperform from market performer.</p>
<p>Analyst Peter Treadway said he raised Telmex's earnings estimates for 1997 to $4.22 a share from $3.85, and for 1998 to $4.13 from $3.84.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9565))</p>
